WEBVTT

00:00:26.663 --> 00:00:30.246
The theme is the case for optimism.

00:00:31.204 --> 00:00:36.121
And yes, I know the world has been hit
with extraordinarily ugly things in

00:00:36.121 --> 00:00:41.621
the last few years. Political division, a
racial reckoning, technology run amuck,

00:00:41.746 --> 00:00:46.079
not to mention a global pandemic and
impending climate catastrophe.

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:48.746
What on earth are we thinking
in this context?

00:00:48.996 --> 00:00:53.912
Optimism just seems so naive and unwanted,
almost annoying.

00:00:54.371 --> 00:00:57.162
So here's my position. Don't think
of optimism as a feeling.

00:00:57.162 --> 00:01:03.246
It's not just this sort of shallow feeling
of hope. Optimism is a search.